WEBVTT

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:07.480
The sky is so blue and the clouds are so white.

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.020
The sun is so bright.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.430
This is literally summer!

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.400
Takao! Over here!

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:21.840
Wait for me, Ayase.

00:00:21.840 --> 00:00:25.260
A hot summer day together as boyfriend and girlfriend.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:32.170
Ayase! Ayase!

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:34.610
Eh? Where's the ocean?

00:00:34.610 --> 00:00:36.460
What happened to our summer?

00:00:36.460 --> 00:00:38.080
What are you saying?

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.460
We're in the middle of PE class.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:44.020
Ayase, go inside already.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:45.890
Okay.

00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:49.250
What is Hanabi thinking about?

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:51.720
A boyfriend-girlfriend summer?

00:00:51.720 --> 00:00:53.760
A date with Takao, perhaps?

00:00:54.680 --> 00:00:57.820
Are you going anywhere with Hiyama?

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.650
No, not really...

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.410
Why!?

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:05.380
Summer is the season for couples!

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.180
Season for couples?

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:12.180
You can go to the ocean or the mountains!

00:01:12.180 --> 00:01:15.520
You just gotta enjoy a romantic date!

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:17.640
That's what my sister told me.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:19.720
Romantic...

00:01:20.110 --> 00:01:22.010
It doesn't have to be somewhere far.

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:24.030
You can just go to the pool nearby.

00:01:24.030 --> 00:01:26.520
What if Hiyama invites you?

00:01:26.770 --> 00:01:28.650
Go! Hiyama!

00:01:28.650 --> 00:01:29.680
Okay!

00:01:30.920 --> 00:01:33.350
I'm going to score now!

00:01:33.350 --> 00:01:35.310
I guess not.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:44.660
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:01:44.660 --> 00:01:48.080
This will be the first summer I spend with my boyfriend.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.560
But...

00:01:49.560 --> 00:01:50.540
Watch out!

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:56.000
Are you okay, Aoi?

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:00.650
This isn't romantic at all.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.450
Are you okay?

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:54.890
Yep. It was just a light hit.

00:03:54.890 --> 00:03:56.150
But...

00:03:56.150 --> 00:03:57.360
But?

00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:00.830
I got hit since I was dozing off.

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:02.590
That was embarrassing.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.120
Aoi, are you okay?

00:04:06.790 --> 00:04:08.000
Hiyama?

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.380
H-Hiyama...

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.900
...came to see Aoi!?

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.320
Is that bad?

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:18.640
We'll get going now.

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.000
Excuse us.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:25.830
Jeez! Those two are too loud.

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:31.290
You look so lame.

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:35.270
It can't be helped. The ball came so quickly.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:39.270
What's the matter?

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:42.040
Hey, Aoi...

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.190
Yeah?

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:45.600
You can swim, right?

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:49.300
Huh? What are you asking?

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:52.290
Here are tickets to the pool.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:54.200
What's the matter?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:04:58.960
The pool?

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.110
I got them from the lottery!

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:08.500
"Go with your friends and your girlfriend!"

00:05:08.500 --> 00:05:09.850
Are you sure?

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.400
If you want to go...

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.750
Okay! I want to go to the pool!

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.520
Then let's go.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.630
There are four tickets.

00:05:21.080 --> 00:05:22.140
Huh?

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:24.770
We can ask Hanabi and Takao too!

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:28.360
Okay.

00:05:28.360 --> 00:05:29.640
Yes!

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.930
Hiyama invited you to go to the pool!?

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:38.580
Yep!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:43.060
He gave me the tickets and said, "Let's go together."

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:47.170
How nice! So nice!

00:05:47.170 --> 00:05:49.130
Going to the pool sounds so nice!

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:52.520
And we have four tickets.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:54.930
Would you and Takao like to come with us?

00:05:55.660 --> 00:05:57.200
Can we?

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.340
Yep!

00:05:58.340 --> 00:06:00.840
It's more fun if everyone goes.

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.500
Then I'll go ask Takao.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:04.200
Okay.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:09.770
A pool date is one of the most important events to get closer to your beloved!

00:06:09.770 --> 00:06:11.310
That's what my sister said.

00:06:11.310 --> 00:06:13.410
Eh? Really?

00:06:13.410 --> 00:06:17.750
You can make his heart swoon by wearing a cute swimsuit and giving off a different vibe.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:20.520
Maybe even heat up your summer love!

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:29.120
But you must be careful of one thing.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:30.150
What is it?

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:35.860
If you wear a really lame swimsuit during the pool date,

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:40.460
then your summer love may fizzle just like a sparkler going out.

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:47.680
Eh!?

00:06:47.680 --> 00:06:52.830
That's why your date will be ruined with a bad swimsuit.

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.010
Be careful!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.810
Miss Marin!

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.050
Please keep on lecturing us!

00:06:59.050 --> 00:07:00.560
Okay!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:04.960
I will choose cute swimsuits for my lost lambs!

00:07:04.960 --> 00:07:06.440
Yes!

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:09.320
Your pool date is this Saturday, right?

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.000
Yep!

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:12.490
Then we gotta buy them now!

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.180
What kind of swimsuit should I wear?

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.870
Pool date, huh?

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:22.230
Hiyama.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.210
I heard about the pool from Ayase.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:27.220
Oh.

00:07:27.220 --> 00:07:30.880
I'm happy that you invited us, but are you fine with it?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.560
What do you mean?

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.920
We had a double date before, right?

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:37.720
Are you okay not being alone with Aoi?

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:43.290
I don't know what to talk to her about if I'm alone with her at the pool.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:44.830
You're right.

00:07:45.330 --> 00:07:47.710
I'm a bit nervous, too.

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:50.460
You're nervous!?

00:07:50.460 --> 00:07:51.720
Yeah.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:54.660
I love Ayase, that's why.

00:07:58.300 --> 00:08:00.480
You're amazing, Takao.

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.080
How?

00:08:10.730 --> 00:08:14.340
Wow! So dazzling!

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:16.610
Which one is good?

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.830
I think these are the best...

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.540
Too naive!

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.700
Miss Marin!

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:30.500
Your boyfriends won't get swooned by those.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.440
Then which ones are good?

00:08:34.750 --> 00:08:36.940
Something like this!

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:39.040
That's...

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:42.260
A pool date means wearing a bikini!

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.690
You need to open up a bit more.

00:08:44.690 --> 00:08:49.760
But wearing a bikini makes your breasts stand out...

00:08:49.760 --> 00:08:54.690
Then I recommend a halter-style neck!

00:08:54.690 --> 00:08:58.640
What if you don't have any breasts?

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:02.920
Then a frilly tube top is the best!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:04.740
Brings out your volume!

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:08.880
It makes your figure better, I guarantee it.

00:09:10.340 --> 00:09:13.590
Let me take your measurements.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:20.920
Yui, have you decided yet?

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.830
Not yet.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:31.200
But I'm thinking about what sort of reaction Hiyama will make.

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.160
That makes me happy.

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:35.510
Yeah, me too.

00:09:36.770 --> 00:09:40.660
At age 12, my first time going to the pool with my boyfriend.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.180
I can't wait!

00:09:56.760 --> 00:10:00.800
Hey, will this swimsuit be okay?

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:03.370
I don't look weird, right?

00:10:03.370 --> 00:10:04.520
Nope!

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:06.870
Let's go.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:07.800
Okay.

00:10:22.020 --> 00:10:23.170
He's there!

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.370
Yeah!

00:10:24.370 --> 00:10:26.190
Yui!

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:27.590
O-Okay!

00:10:55.680 --> 00:10:57.050
You look cute.

00:11:02.590 --> 00:11:03.960
How does it look?

00:11:06.930 --> 00:11:08.250
What's wrong?

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:14.440
Eh? What's this all about?

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:16.030
Do I look weird?

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:17.770
No...

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:23.480
It's just different from before.

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:29.780
Hey, hey, how do I look?

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:32.100
Hey!

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:35.380
It fits you really well, Ayase.

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:38.680
I like the color.

00:11:38.680 --> 00:11:40.250
Really?

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.160
Me too!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.940
Takao!

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:49.550
You can't swim?

00:11:49.550 --> 00:11:50.890
I can't.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:53.890
You invited me to the pool even though you don't know how to swim?

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:57.860
Well, I wanted to come to the pool with you.

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.500
Me too.

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.960
I'm happy I could be here with you.

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:16.260
We should go swimming, too.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.520
Got ya!

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.880
Can you do that, Aoi?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:27.680
I wonder if I can?

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:37.990
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:42.550
My first pool date makes my heart pound nonstop!

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:03.720
Sorry about before.

00:13:04.620 --> 00:13:09.260
I didn't react in a mature way to your swimsuit, unlike Takao.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.590
That's all right, I...

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:12.620
Watch out!

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.180
Thank you.

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:18.420
Jeez, who threw this?

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:21.530
Oh? What a coincidence!

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:23.490
Why are you guys here?

00:13:23.490 --> 00:13:29.370
"A pool date is one of the most important events to get closer to your beloved!"

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:30.880
You heard that?

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.560
Who cares?

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:35.840
A pool isn't only for couples like you!

00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:37.630
That's right! That's right!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.720
Let's enjoy summer to its fullest!

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:44.380
Enjoy the summer!

00:13:57.090 --> 00:13:59.020
This is so fun!

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.760
You're amazing, Ayase.

00:14:00.760 --> 00:14:03.840
Let's go over there next!

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:05.910
Don't rush! It's dangerous.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:08.480
I'm fine, I'm fine.

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.230
Ayase!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.440
Grab onto me!

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:16.040
Don't you let go.

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:23.690
I got a midsummer quote!

00:14:23.690 --> 00:14:26.180
Hotter than the hottest temperatures!

00:14:26.180 --> 00:14:29.010
Hey! Stop interrupting us!

00:14:29.010 --> 00:14:31.860
Okie dokie, please continue.

00:14:31.860 --> 00:14:36.010
Our pool date will be all ruined!

00:14:37.970 --> 00:14:41.580
Why do Eikou and his friends get in our way so much?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.520
There's nowhere to hide in the pool either.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:46.340
Wanna go home for today?

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:50.010
I don't want to go yet...

00:14:50.010 --> 00:14:51.240
Watch out!

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.820
Thank you.

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:58.410
You always seem on top of things, but at times you can be a bit clumsy.

00:14:58.410 --> 00:14:59.470
I'm sorry.

00:15:10.110 --> 00:15:11.930
Of course we'll notice you!

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:13.280
Hiyama.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:16.660
Sorry. I'll go get some water.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.260
Okay.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:27.080
Hiyama! Let's play beach volleyball!

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.310
No.

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:31.760
You wanna chat with your girlfriend instead?

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:37.660
Even the cool Hiyama turned into a normal boyfriend?

00:15:38.810 --> 00:15:43.150
Go right ahead to your girlfriend.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:44.800
I accept your challenge!

00:15:46.260 --> 00:15:50.070
If we win, then you guys will get out of here.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:53.960
A duel among men?

00:15:56.200 --> 00:16:00.200
Jeez, where did Hiyama go?

00:16:02.860 --> 00:16:03.540
Pass!

00:16:03.540 --> 00:16:05.440
Spike!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.910
Yes!

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:09.720
Crap!

00:16:10.090 --> 00:16:12.780
Why is he playing with Eikou and his friends?

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.020
Eikou!

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:25.070
Yui!

00:16:25.070 --> 00:16:27.360
Huh? Where's Hiyama?

00:16:30.890 --> 00:16:35.010
Eh? Why is he playing with Eikou and his friends?

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:38.280
I wonder why...

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:42.150
I'll go buy some juice.

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:44.190
Yui...

00:16:48.310 --> 00:16:51.950
Give me two orange juice and two apple juice, please.

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:56.400
I just wanted to have a normal date.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:00.210
Why don't things ever go smoothly?

00:17:00.460 --> 00:17:01.330
Take this!

00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:11.860
Did we lose?

00:17:11.860 --> 00:17:14.070
As you promised, get out of here!

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:17.760
W-We'll remember this!

00:17:19.860 --> 00:17:20.960
Hiyama.

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:24.480
Why are you playing with Eikou and the others?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:27.200
Well, it's because...

00:17:27.200 --> 00:17:32.020
No matter what it is, you shouldn't leave your girl all alone during a date!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.820
Can I carry this by myself?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:41.420
Hey, do you want to hang out?

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:45.540
Want to create some summer memories with us?

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:49.850
M-My friend is waiting for me.

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:51.500
It's fine! It's fine!

00:17:51.500 --> 00:17:52.820
Let's go.

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:54.640
Please stop.

00:17:54.640 --> 00:17:56.150
Let's play.

00:17:57.690 --> 00:18:00.460
Save me, Hiyama!

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:02.400
Hey! Stop that!

00:18:02.870 --> 00:18:04.300
Hiyama!

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:06.850
Oh? Your younger brother?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.760
That's so sweet! You're protecting your sister.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.500
No, I'm not.

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:18.500
I'm her boyfriend.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:28.300
Oh, she had a boyfriend.

00:18:28.300 --> 00:18:30.230
Should have said that first.

00:18:30.450 --> 00:18:31.770
Are you okay?

00:18:31.770 --> 00:18:33.670
Yes.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.160
Yui!

00:18:37.480 --> 00:18:39.410
Thank goodness!

00:18:39.410 --> 00:18:40.840
Yeah!

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:45.850
Yui, Eikou and the others are gone, thanks to Hiyama!

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:47.390
Eh? That's what it was?

00:18:47.390 --> 00:18:52.910
Yeah! They promised to leave if Hiyama won at beach volleyball.

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:54.730
So that's why...

00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:57.840
What?

00:18:57.840 --> 00:18:59.520
Nothing.

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:03.720
Let's start over the pool date!

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:04.750
Okay!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.360
Rock, paper, scissors!

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:11.160
Eh? I'm it?

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:13.240
Hanabi, do your best!

00:19:13.240 --> 00:19:14.750
Time to run!

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:20.240
Ayase.

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:21.860
Takao!

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:23.600
Touch!

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:25.580
Here I go!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:28.500
Takao's it?

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.230
He'll catch up!

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:32.360
Aoi, go into the water!

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:04.500
The pool was so much fun!

00:20:04.500 --> 00:20:06.320
I want to go again!

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:08.340
Yeah, let's go again sometime.

00:20:10.410 --> 00:20:11.870
What's the matter?

00:20:12.260 --> 00:20:13.440
I'm sorry.

00:20:15.140 --> 00:20:17.270
I'm sorry for leaving you all alone.

00:20:17.270 --> 00:20:19.900
I made you experience something scary.

00:20:21.580 --> 00:20:26.990
I was lonely waiting all alone, but I'm really happy you protected me.

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:31.780
I'm sorry I'm not like Takao.

00:20:32.110 --> 00:20:33.620
That's not true!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.360
I think you're the best!

00:20:40.790 --> 00:20:41.970
Aoi...

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:53.500
You know, my mom's old place has an awesome view of the ocean!

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.140
Wanna go sometime?

00:20:57.540 --> 00:21:01.320
Just the two of us...

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:03.280
Okay.

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:07.700
Aoi Yui, age 12.

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:11.820
This is the first time I've spent a special summer with my boyfriend.

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:53.740
My summer with everyone.

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.440
A page from my memories.

00:22:58.520 --> 00:23:00.850
I got sunburnt!

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:04.460
Hanabi, you didn't put on any sunscreen?

00:23:04.460 --> 00:23:07.480
I should have lectured you on that, too.

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:10.400
What should I do? What should I do?

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:11.150
Ayase.

00:23:11.430 --> 00:23:13.950
Don't look at me, Takao!

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:15.460
We're going to this, right?

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:20.250
Fireworks festival?

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:23.300
Want to go to the fireworks festival together?

00:23:23.300 --> 00:23:26.050
That's really happening?

00:23:26.050 --> 00:23:28.540
Yep! You want to go together?

00:23:28.540 --> 00:23:30.250
Yes!

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:33.780
Ayase Hanabi, age 12.

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:37.140
Summer vacation is coming right up!

00:23:40.610 --> 00:23:43.130
It should have been a fireworks date with Ayase,

00:23:43.130 --> 00:23:44.730
but everyone came anyway.

00:23:44.730 --> 00:23:48.900
It's all right. There are plenty of chances to be alone.

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:52.340
I wonder if Hiyama and Aoi are having fun, too?

00:23:52.340 --> 00:23:55.760
Next time I'll also make your hearts throb.
